      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>Option bit for <see cref="P:Android.Icu.Text.Bidi.ReorderingOptions" />: insert Bidi marks (LRM or RLM) when needed to ensure correct result of a reordering to a Logical order. This option must be set or reset before calling <c>Bidi.SetPara</c>. This option is significant only with reordering modes which generate a result with Logical order, specifically: <see cref="F:Android.Icu.Text.Bidi.ReorderRunsOnly" />, <see cref="F:Android.Icu.Text.Bidi.ReorderInverseNumbersAsL" />, <see cref="F:Android.Icu.Text.Bidi.ReorderInverseLikeDirect" />, and <see cref="F:Android.Icu.Text.Bidi.ReorderInverseForNumbersSpecial" />. If this option is set in conjunction with reordering mode <see cref="F:Android.Icu.Text.Bidi.ReorderInverseNumbersAsL" /> or with <see cref="P:Android.Icu.Text.Bidi.Inverse" /> set to <see langword="true" />, it implies option <see cref="F:Android.Icu.Text.Bidi.InsertLrmForNumeric" /> in calls to <see cref="M:Android.Icu.Text.Bidi.WriteReordered(Android.Icu.Text.BidiOptions)" />. For other reordering modes, a minimum number of LRM or RLM characters will be added to the source text after reordering it so as to ensure round trip, i.e. when applying the inverse reordering mode on the resulting logical text with removal of Bidi marks (option <see cref="F:Android.Icu.Text.BidiOptions.OptionRemoveControls" /> set before calling <c>Bidi.SetPara</c> or option <see cref="F:Android.Icu.Text.Bidi.RemoveBidiControls" /> in <see cref="M:Android.Icu.Text.Bidi.WriteReordered(Android.Icu.Text.BidiOptions)" />), the result will be identical to the source text in the first transformation. This option will be ignored if specified together with option <see cref="F:Android.Icu.Text.BidiOptions.OptionRemoveControls" />. It inhibits option <see cref="F:Android.Icu.Text.Bidi.RemoveBidiControls" /> in calls to <see cref="M:Android.Icu.Text.Bidi.WriteReordered(Android.Icu.Text.BidiOptions)" /> and it implies option <see cref="F:Android.Icu.Text.Bidi.InsertLrmForNumeric" /> in calls to that method if the reordering mode is <see cref="F:Android.Icu.Text.Bidi.ReorderInverseNumbersAsL" />. Cast the write option constants to <see cref="T:Android.Icu.Text.BidiOptions" /> when passing them to that method.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/icu/text/Bidi#OPTION_INSERT_MARKS" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.icu.text.Bidi.OPTION_INSERT_MARKS</code>.</a></format></para>
