        <summary>
          <para>Option bit for <see cref="P:Android.Icu.Text.Bidi.ReorderingOptions" />: remove Bidi control characters. This option must be set or reset before calling <c>Bidi.SetPara</c>. This option nullifies option <see cref="F:Android.Icu.Text.BidiOptions.OptionInsertMarks" />. It inhibits option <see cref="F:Android.Icu.Text.Bidi.InsertLrmForNumeric" /> in calls to <see cref="M:Android.Icu.Text.Bidi.WriteReordered(Android.Icu.Text.BidiOptions)" /> and it implies option <see cref="F:Android.Icu.Text.Bidi.RemoveBidiControls" /> in calls to that method. Cast the write option constants to <see cref="T:Android.Icu.Text.BidiOptions" /> when passing them to that method.</para>
